# Story 1.5 Q4 ruling — generated Go code under gen/ is **vendored** (committed
# to the repo) so `go build` from a fresh clone works without the buf cli.
# CI runs `buf generate && git diff --exit-code packages/proto/gen/` to catch
# drift. Therefore: NO `gen/` line here.

# Buf's local cache / scratch artifacts only.
.buf-build/
